---
/**
 * Privacy Policy (EN) — faithful translation of politica-privacidad.astro.
 * Same facts, same legal grounding (Ley 25.326 arts. 4, 5, 6, 11, 12, 14, 16
 * and 21) — nothing added or changed beyond language. Keep both files in
 * sync when the Spanish content changes.
 */
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BreadcrumbSchema from '@/components/seo/BreadcrumbSchema.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '@/data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | DGV Business Consulting"
  description="How DGV Business Consulting collects, uses and protects the personal data of visitors to this site and users of the contact form."
>
  <BreadcrumbSchema
    items={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/en' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/en/privacy-policy' }]}
  />

  <section class="bg-bg-tint pt-32 pb-16 md:pt-40 md:pb-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-blue-700 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-small">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 font-heading font-bold text-h1 text-navy-700">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lead text-slate-500">Last updated: August 26, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <p>
          This policy explains what personal data DGV Business Consulting collects through{' '}
          <strong>dgvbusiness.com</strong>, for what purpose, who it's shared with, and how you can
          exercise your rights, in compliance with Argentina's Ley 25.326 (Personal Data Protection
          Law).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-h3 text-navy-700 mb-3">1. Data controller</h2>
        <p>
          The party responsible for personal data collected through this site is{' '}
          <strong>DGV Business Consulting</strong>, operated by Daniel Gustavo Velázquez (Argentine
          Tax ID / CUIT 20-18125486-7), with address at Martín J. Haedo 1450, Muñiz, Partido de San
          Miguel, Buenos Aires Province, Argentina.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Contact for questions about this policy or your personal data:{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`} class="text-blue-700 underline hover:text-blue-500">
            {siteConfig.email}
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-h3 text-navy-700 mb-3">2. What data we collect</h2>
        <p>
          We collect personal data only when you voluntarily provide it through the site's{' '}
          <strong>contact form</strong>:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-1.5">
          <li>Name (required)</li>
          <li>Company (required)</li>
          <li>Email (required)</li>
          <li>Phone (optional)</li>
          <li>Inquiry type — SME, Aviation &amp; Logistics Industry, or other (required)</li>
          <li>Message (optional)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Fields marked as required are necessary for us to respond to your inquiry; if you don't
          fill them in, we won't be able to contact you. The remaining fields are optional, and
          leaving them blank has no consequence other than giving us less context about your
          inquiry.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The site also automatically collects browsing data through Google Analytics 4 (see
          section 5, "Cookies and analytics").
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-h3 text-navy-700 mb-3">3. How we use your data</h2>
        <p>We use the data you provide exclusively to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-1.5">
          <li>Respond to your inquiry and set up a conversation or call.</li>
          <li>Prepare business proposals when relevant.</li>
          <li>Manage the business relationship, if you decide to move forward with our services.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We don't use your data for any purpose other than those listed, and we don't use it to
          build advertising profiles or send you marketing communications without your additional,
          explicit consent.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-h3 text-navy-700 mb-3">4. Who we share your data with</h2>
        <p>
          We don't sell or share your personal data with third parties for commercial purposes. We
          do use the following providers to operate the site, which process data on our behalf:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-1.5">
          <li>
            <strong>Formspree</strong> (Formspree, Inc., United States) — processes and delivers
            contact form submissions to us.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> (Google LLC, United States) — analyzes aggregate
            site usage through cookies (see section 5).
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          If you click through to message us on WhatsApp, that conversation is subject to
          WhatsApp/Meta's privacy policy. If you click to schedule a call, Calendly processes that
          data under its own privacy policy. In both cases, you leave our site for a third-party
          service we don't control.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Formspree and Google are based in the United States, so submitting the form and browsing
          the site involve an <strong>international data transfer</strong> to that country. By
          completing and submitting the form, or by continuing to browse the site, you consent to
          that transfer, which is necessary for these services to work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-h3 text-navy-700 mb-3">5. Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>
          The site uses Google Analytics 4 cookies to understand, in aggregate, how the site is
          used (pages visited, clicks on WhatsApp or on scheduling a call, form submissions). We
          don't use advertising or cross-site tracking cookies.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You can block or delete these cookies from your browser's settings at any time; the site
          will keep working normally, though we'll stop receiving that aggregate usage data. For
          the exact list of cookies we use and how to disable them, see our{' '}
          <a href="/en/cookie-policy" class="text-blue-700 underline hover:text-blue-500">
            Cookie Policy
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-h3 text-navy-700 mb-3">6. How long we keep your data</h2>
        <p>
          We keep contact form data for as long as our business exchange with you lasts, and for as
          long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in section 3. If no business
          relationship moves forward, you can request the deletion of your data at any time (see
          section 8).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-h3 text-navy-700 mb-3">7. Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable measures to protect your personal data. However, no method of
          transmission over the internet is completely secure, so we can't guarantee absolute
          security.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-h3 text-navy-700 mb-3">8. Your rights (ARCO)</h2>
        <p>
          Under Ley 25.326, you have the right to access, rectify, update, and request the deletion
          of your personal data free of charge. To exercise these rights, email us at{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`} class="text-blue-700 underline hover:text-blue-500">
            {siteConfig.email}
          </a>{' '}
          stating your name and which piece of data you'd like to exercise that right over. We'll
          respond within the timeframes set by law.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The <strong>Agencia de Acceso a la Información Pública (AAIP)</strong>, the enforcement
          authority for Ley 25.326, is the body you can file a complaint with if you believe your
          rights weren't respected.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-h3 text-navy-700 mb-3">9. Children</h2>
        <p>
          This site is aimed at businesses and professionals; it is not directed at minors, and we
          do not knowingly collect personal data from minors.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-h3 text-navy-700 mb-3">10. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy to reflect changes to the site or to applicable regulations.
          The date of the last update appears at the top of this page.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
